rows.method:
Monotonicity and the limit are DERIVED. The engine encloses P_atom by Jacobi–Anger:
- I_n(6β) from two exact series plus exact backward recurrence;
- ∫_{θ_ε}^{π} cos(nθ) sin^2 θ dθ in closed form, with Chebyshev values at cos θ_ε = 1 - ε;
- sin θ_ε, θ_ε and π enclosed rationally.
As a second route, certified monotone-piece quadrature of the s-integral. Q(3/2, y) = erfc(√y) + 2√(y/π) e^-y by rational series.

rows.falsifier:
Any of the following:
- P_atom >= Q(3/2, 12p^2) at some β;
- P_atom decreasing between grid β;
- a rate readout outside its bracket.

